rl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.410" end="00:37.550"><span begin="00:36.410" end="00:36.596">Don't </span><span begin="00:36.596" end="00:36.817">play </span><span begin="00:36.817" end="00:36.969">with </span><span begin="00:36.969" end="00:37.121">a </span><span begin="00:37.121" end="00:37.378">girl </span><span begin="00:37.378" end="00:37.550">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.975" end="00:39.057"><span begin="00:37.975" end="00:39.057">Oooo</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.286" end="00:40.695"><span begin="00:39.286" end="00:39.470">I </span><span begin="00:39.470" end="00:39.726">see </span><span begin="00:39.726" end="00:39.883">you </span><span begin="00:39.883" end="00:40.695">babe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.483" end="00:42.689"><span begin="00:41.483" end="00:41.755">Don't </span><span begin="00:41.755" end="00:42.689">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.899" end="00:45.115"><span begin="00:42.899" end="00:43.109">Too </span><span begin="00:43.109" end="00:43.494">much </span><span begin="00:43.494" end="00:43.875">before </span><span begin="00:43.875" end="00:44.033">the </span><span begin="00:44.033" end="00:44.516">finish </span><span begin="00:44.516" end="00:45.115">line</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.315" end="00:46.425"><span begin="00:45.315" end="00:45.467">It's </span><span begin="00:45.467" end="00:46.425">true</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.827" end="00:48.438"><span begin="00:46.827" end="00:47.146">I </span><span begin="00:47.146" end="00:47.481">ain't </span><span begin="00:47.481" end="00:47.753">no </span><span begin="00:47.753" end="00:48.137">pick </span><span begin="00:48.137" end="00:48.438">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.438" end="00:51.701"><span begin="00:48.438" end="00:48.683">That's </span><span begin="00:48.683" end="00:48.933">not </span><span begin="00:48.933" end="00:49.273">how </span><span begin="00:49.273" end="00:49.587">you're </span>